<% content_for :title, "About Us — No Crumbs" %>

<div class="nc-static-page">
  <div class="nc-static-hero">
    <h1>About <span>NoCrumbs</span></h1>
    <p class="nc-static-lead">A place to share meals, find food friends, and never eat alone.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="nc-static-body">
    <section>
      <h2>What we're building</h2>
      <p>NoCrumbs is a social app for food lovers. Great meals are better when shared. Host a dinner. Join a potluck. Share what you cooked tonight. NoCrumbs helps you find people who love food as much as you do.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>The team</h2>
      <p>NoCrumbs was made by students at Northwestern University. We built it for CS 397: Software Studio. Our team includes designers, developers, and people who think a lot about food.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Source code</h2>
      <p>NoCrumbs is open source. The full codebase is available on GitHub.</p>
      <a href="https://github.com/NU-CS-Software-Studio-Spring-26/project-no-crumbs" class="nc-btn nc-btn-secondary" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        <i class="bi bi-github"></i> View on GitHub
      </a>
    </section>
  </div>
</div>
